{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"type-alias-nonfeaturekeys","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Alias: NonFeatureKeys"}]},{"type":"code","value":"type NonFeatureKeys =\n  | \"aggregationFns\"\n  | \"columnMeta\"\n  | \"coreRowModel\"\n  | \"expandedRowModel\"\n  | \"facetedMinMaxValues\"\n  | \"facetedRowModel\"\n  | \"facetedUniqueValues\"\n  | \"filterFns\"\n  | \"filterMeta\"\n  | \"filteredRowModel\"\n  | \"groupedRowModel\"\n  | \"paginatedRowModel\"\n  | \"sortFns\"\n  | \"sortedRowModel\"\n  | \"tableMeta\";","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/types/TableFeatures.ts#L70","children":[{"type":"text","value":"types/TableFeatures.ts:70"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Keys of the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"features"},{"type":"text","value":" option that are not table features themselves."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"These slots carry per-table types ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tableMeta"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"columnMeta"},{"type":"text","value":"), row model\nfactories, and row model function registries. They are stripped from the\ntable's registered "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"_features"},{"type":"text","value":" at runtime and excluded from feature-derived\noptions such as the generated "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"debug*"},{"type":"text","value":" keys."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-alias-nonfeaturekeys","text":"Type Alias: NonFeatureKeys","level":1}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Type Alias: NonFeatureKeys\n\n```ts\ntype NonFeatureKeys =\n  | \"aggregationFns\"\n  | \"columnMeta\"\n  | \"coreRowModel\"\n  | \"expandedRowModel\"\n  | \"facetedMinMaxValues\"\n  | \"facetedRowModel\"\n  | \"facetedUniqueValues\"\n  | \"filterFns\"\n  | \"filterMeta\"\n  | \"filteredRowModel\"\n  | \"groupedRowModel\"\n  | \"paginatedRowModel\"\n  | \"sortFns\"\n  | \"sortedRowModel\"\n  | \"tableMeta\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [types/TableFeatures.ts:70](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/types/TableFeatures.ts#L70)\n\nKeys of the `features` option that are not table features themselves.\n\nThese slots carry per-table types (`tableMeta`, `columnMeta`), row model\nfactories, and row model function registries. They are stripped from the\ntable's registered `_features` at runtime and excluded from feature-derived\noptions such as the generated `debug*` keys.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: NonFeatureKeys\ntitle: NonFeatureKeys\n---\n\n# Type Alias: NonFeatureKeys\n\n```ts\ntype NonFeatureKeys =\n  | \"aggregationFns\"\n  | \"columnMeta\"\n  | \"coreRowModel\"\n  | \"expandedRowModel\"\n  | \"facetedMinMaxValues\"\n  | \"facetedRowModel\"\n  | \"facetedUniqueValues\"\n  | \"filterFns\"\n  | \"filterMeta\"\n  | \"filteredRowModel\"\n  | \"groupedRowModel\"\n  | \"paginatedRowModel\"\n  | \"sortFns\"\n  | \"sortedRowModel\"\n  | \"tableMeta\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [types/TableFeatures.ts:70](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/types/TableFeatures.ts#L70)\n\nKeys of the `features` option that are not table features themselves.\n\nThese slots carry per-table types (`tableMeta`, `columnMeta`), row model\nfactories, and row model function registries. They are stripped from the\ntable's registered `_features` at runtime and excluded from feature-derived\noptions such as the generated `debug*` keys.\n"}
